    "title": "Calendar Launcher",
    "description": "Manage your monthly schedule and stay organized with Calendar Launcher. Get instant access to a simple calendar planner with a single swipe from your home screen. Our calendar app is a launcher that lets you create events and set reminders for birthdays, dinner dates, business meetings and appointments. \r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 One-swipe access\r\n\u2713 Monthly calendar view\r\n\u2713 Event scheduling\r\n\u2713 Reminders\r\n\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: With one swipe from your home screen, you can quickly access Calendar Launcher\u2019s features. No more app hunting \u2013 your calendar planner is just a swipe away.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Easy schedule management: Get a complete picture of your monthly schedule with our simple launcher app. Easily switch between months, view events scheduled on specific dates and plan your time.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udccc Create events: From important appointments and deadlines to birthdays and brunch with friends, this launcher application allows you to easily add events to your calendar. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Set reminders: Stay on top of your schedule and never miss a beat. Add reminders for events including vacations, anniversaries, birthdays, business meetings, and calls on the calendar launcher app. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the Calendar Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get quick access to a simple calendar and event planner. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.\r\n\r\nTake control of your schedule with Calendar Launcher. Create events and get things done, easily set reminders for tasks, and simplify your daily routine with our easy-to-use calendar planner. \r\n\r\nDownload our launcher application and easily access a calendar from your minus one screen.\r\n\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Calendar Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://dailycalendar.app/#faq\r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://dailycalendar.app/contact-us\r\n\r\nAndroid is a trademark of Google LLC",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manage your monthly schedule and stay organized with Calendar Launcher. Get instant access to a simple calendar planner with a single swipe from your home screen. Our calendar app is a launcher that lets you create events and set reminders for birthdays, dinner dates, business meetings and appointments. <br><br>Key features:<br>\u2713 One-swipe access<br>\u2713 Monthly calendar view<br>\u2713 Event scheduling<br>\u2713 Reminders<br>\u2713 Multiple access points to search on Yahoo<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access: With one swipe from your home screen, you can quickly access Calendar Launcher\u2019s features. No more app hunting \u2013 your calendar planner is just a swipe away.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 Easy schedule management: Get a complete picture of your monthly schedule with our simple launcher app. Easily switch between months, view events scheduled on specific dates and plan your time.<br><br> \ud83d\udccc Create events: From important appointments and deadlines to birthdays and brunch with friends, this launcher application allows you to easily add events to your calendar. <br><br>\ud83d\udd14 Set reminders: Stay on top of your schedule and never miss a beat. Add reminders for events including vacations, anniversaries, birthdays, business meetings, and calls on the calendar launcher app. <br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut: Use the Calendar Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get quick access to a simple calendar and event planner. <br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search with search results powered by Yahoo: Finding what you need has never been easier. Enjoy an enhanced search experience with access to Yahoo web search via multiple access points.<br><br>Take control of your schedule with Calendar Launcher. Create events and get things done, easily set reminders for tasks, and simplify your daily routine with our easy-to-use calendar planner. <br><br>Download our launcher application and easily access a calendar from your minus one screen.<br><br>Please write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.<br><br>You give your consent to install Calendar Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app&#39;s Terms and Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy.<br><br>Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.<br><br><br>Explore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://dailycalendar.app/#faq<br>For questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://dailycalendar.app/contact-us<br><br>Android is a trademark of Google LLC",
